  Don't confuse "arbitrariness" with "cultural non-neutrality".  It's
arbitrary that we don't chop off our pinkie toes on the left foot, and yet,
I don't know of any culture that does so, so "keeping pinkie toes intact"
is culturally neutral.

     --gejyspa



